<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.antigen.raises ~ a ban on the always-carried antigen board

`lares nexus kapae <nym> [--reason <text>] [--nexus <aid>]` raises a quorum-signed ban; a banned presenter draws Mu. `--list` folds the currently-kāpae'd set. Where the seats rest in two vaults, `--out <partial>` signs with the seats held here and `--from <partial>` cosigns and lands. Fail closed: a sub-quorum or unseated charter refuses and writes nothing.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ raise · list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`raise` params=`nym/<nym> reason/[[spam ring]] ~ raise a ban`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`list/true ~ fold the kāpae'd set`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ nym · reason · list · nexus · out · from

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nym` params=`takes/nym seat/1 as/<nym> ~ the presenter set aside`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`reason` params=`takes/words ~ why`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`list` params=`~ fold the currently-kāpae'd set`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the partial for the next vault`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from` params=`takes/host-path ~ judge and cosign a partial another vault wrote`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ the seat quorum signs; a sub-quorum refuses`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.antigen.raises list/true]] ~ no nym, or a malformed one`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ raised

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`raised` params=`exit/0 ~ the ban landed, or the partial written, or the folded set`>>
```

